{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8106457749821af39f454cf4cb8014f06dd36dc5d3001d49564ef92fa19c3f25", "ja": "（もうすぐ星梨花のステージが始まる。\nひとりで歌うのは久しぶりだが、星梨花の様子は……）", "zh": "（星梨花的舞台马上就要开始了。虽然她已经很久没有独自唱歌了，不过星梨花现在的状态……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc37a595489806fe528f684f8b0bff4b549ea9d1269ec6808e9eb23e05f369ee", "ja": "お客さん、たくさんですね……。\nちょっとだけドキドキします。", "zh": "观众真多啊……  \n我有一点点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "da4d5ddeb9995932420db9c1991722c471100294f5d65fb6392e20367ba3755d", "ja": "でも、今日のためにいっぱいレッスンしてきましたから\n……。みんなに喜んでもらえるように頑張ります！", "zh": "不过，为了今天，我已经进行了好多练习……\n为了让大家开心，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3741c156b90d60a16d22112d8b8a07ac20540aa024bd580889f266e866a72a8f", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n星梨花がいつもどおりで安心したよ。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n看到星梨花和平时一样，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "66ce3a1edf48ea00b30d1a56d47c32d71d0e2c774d7469e6fe941e29aeed342d", "ja": "安心？　どうしてですか？", "zh": "放心？　为什么这么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "496132b66e4bd92623cbc5d1fa725380326868c7d0932c475fb931725b18c1d1", "ja": "星梨花の初ステージのことを、ちょっと思い出してね。\nすごく緊張してたなと思って。", "zh": "我只是稍微想起了星梨花第一次登台的事。\n那时候她真的非常紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "67fb77fda46f598e8c73b8ce32cc25a63f12d1a54e401cf391c5d35edfc4978b", "ja": "あっ、そうですね。……あの時は、わからないこと\nばかりで、わたしも不安でいっぱいでした。", "zh": "啊，是呢。……那时候，尽是不明白的事情，我也充满了不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "0c9099b4f2640d9231a01dd032f9b624eac7627d8b252ef1a1973d27325c5cd1", "ja": "でも、今は違います。わからないこともあるけど……\n知ってることも増えましたから。", "zh": "不过，现在不一样了。虽然还有不明白的事情……但我知道的事情也变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a6e9803941e1d9ea1515a93b29f874e11b206886f49471200a4d65ecb3961f54", "ja": "そうだな。たくさんのことを経験して成長した……。\n星梨花が一生懸命頑張った結果だよ。", "zh": "是啊。你经历了许多事情，也成长了……这都是星梨花努力奋斗的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "c74fd86e0e5b0a11fcb668e82012c733aa942f666e5c2d85023b138c19434888", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪　ジュニオールも、\nわたしのステージをみたら喜んでくれるかな？", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您♪朱尼奥尔看到我的舞台，也会开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f3aca2c61b8769e7bb69c8d65f2dad1c38acdddddab39ef5d86ac32724552033", "ja": "ジュニオールって、星梨花が飼ってる犬のことだな。\n楽しそうな星梨花の姿をみたら、大喜びじゃないかな。", "zh": "你说的朱尼奥尔，就是星梨花养的那只狗吧。\n看到星梨花开心的样子，它肯定也会特别高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "914f6011675f97f99b1429eb50ef13428968949da167ed725cd22f2875192e16", "ja": "ふふっ。きっとそうですね。ジュニオールも、\nわたしをいっぱい応援してくれてますから。", "zh": "呵呵。一定是这样呢。因为朱尼奥尔也一直在为我加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "8c3eecd331c1477d7b2d2920e378605500d54187c97cd35dec04feb2dfd6d0ac", "ja": "ジュニオールがいてくれるから……\nわたしは、アイドルを続けられてるんです。", "zh": "因为有朱尼奥尔陪着我……\n我才能继续当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "7779d331fe2d9c663a149c7e655f72f3c483c919e251931bb0acf833d23a9941", "ja": "はい。小さい時から、ずっとそばにいてくれて……。\nわたしが落ち込んでいると励ましてくれますし……。", "zh": "是的。从我小时候起，它就一直陪在我身边……  \n每当我情绪低落时，都会鼓励我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "85012e7aeb0c34652e0cd14255eb8a9cd3a1563239d406b00fdb27ae76c8f9ca", "ja": "うれしそうにしていると、一緒に喜んでくれます。\n悲しいときは、泣き止むまで近くにいてくれて。", "zh": "看到我开心，它也会跟着一起高兴。\n难过的时候，还会一直待在我身边，直到我不哭为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "a9ed4d8ee8cec0fda3988a4048ac452deb708ce31783193b690627ac1b74f728", "ja": "一緒にいると元気になれるんです。あったかくて\n優しくて、大好きなお友達……ううん、家族です。", "zh": "和它在一起就会变得精神起来。温暖又温柔，是我最喜欢的朋友……不，是家人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "18769c280276f59429ce1b8654d529b79605a5cd74469469319d065aedfb34f0", "ja": "そうだったんだな。きっと、\nジュニオールと出会ったのは運命だったのかもな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。也许，遇见朱尼奥尔就是命中注定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "6428812362cef75ad75616451905eee6c6a18c29239d5623f091a2f56d29683b", "ja": "運命……えへへ。それなら、劇場のみんなや\n{$P$}さん、そして……。", "zh": "命运……嘿嘿。要是这样的话，那剧场的大家、{$P$}先生，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "46673aaf65556b02b2276b6ab8067c335e9b32cd69b965b380ed80bdfb1f8a9a", "ja": "ファンのみなさんに出会えたのも、運命ですね！", "zh": "能与各位粉丝相遇，也是命运呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fd1d5c6fdf055df115039c3dfb0235630c123ecbffcad77fb7082ba03d8b5fc8", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。このあとのステージで、\n今感じてる思いをぶつけてきてほしい。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。希望你在接下来的舞台上，把此刻的心情尽情展现出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c6245f30bd0b47419f180441bb2d20919cb56df44e887ff4fd23b2f33e603b1d", "ja": "星梨花の思いが、たくさんの人に伝わるように。\nそしたら、みんなも喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "让星梨花的心意传达给更多人。\n这样一来，大家也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "859e485e56e241fe71aa0c6729740e6d8c568cece272233b8bdc4e275a346af2", "ja": "……わかりました！　わたしのこの気持ちを、\n全力のステージで届けてきますね！", "zh": "……我明白了！我会用全力以赴的舞台，\n把我的这份心意传达给大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0414_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2956c6fcbe9b77ef5fdfdb16b264e900f1188c4622f3e23b3089895d58edf3ae", "ja": "（ステージでの星梨花は、眩しいくらいの笑顔だった。\n観客もみんな笑顔で……最高のステージだ！）", "zh": "（舞台上的星梨花笑容耀眼夺目。\n观众们也全都面带笑容……真是最棒的舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
